# Upstream bounty flavor text rewrites. Some of these were fucking rancid.
bounty-description-artifact = Central Command would like to study the material properties of an extradimensional artifact. Send one over once you're done investigating its less mundane properties.
bounty-description-corn = After the release of a much-anticipated movie, NanoTrasen's entertainment division is struggling to keep up with the demand for popcorn. Ship them some corn so they can make more.
bounty-description-crayon = The NanoTrasen Youth Enrichment Center is running low on art supplies. Ship them some crayons.
bounty-description-donk-pocket = Relations with Donk Co. have fallen through, and the fridge at Central Command is empty. We need Donk-Pockets, now.
bounty-description-flesh-monster = We've recently received reports of some kind of flesh monster infestation onboard several stations. Send us a few samples of these creatures so we can investigate.
bounty-description-flower = Staff at Central Command is complaining about a lack of nature on the station. Send us some flowers to brighten the place up.
bounty-description-galaxythistle = An unpreventable plasma leak has caused mass poisoning in a nearby station. They require a shipment of galaxythistle to prepare stelloxadone.
bounty-description-lime = A nearby station is struggling to keep up with the demands of their bar's patrons. Ship them some limes to help out.
bounty-description-monkey-cube = Central Command's genetics division would like to study the subtle differences between artificial lifeforms. Ship us some monkey cubes.
bounty-description-mouse = As part of the Clean Station Initiative, NanoTrasen is offering a bounty for proof of pest elimination.
bounty-description-research-disk = The Spider Clan has raided a nearby station. Send them some research disks to help them get back on their feet.
bounty-description-soup = Our kitchen staff are sick, and the marines are getting hungry. We need a large shipment of soup! OORAH!!
bounty-description-syringe = A material shortage has hit a nearby hospital, and they require a shipment of sterile syringes.
bounty-description-trash = As part of the Clean Station Initiative, NanoTrasen is offering a monetary reward for garbage disposal.
bounty-description-labeler = Due to a bureaucratic error, our sorting center almost sent hundreds of crates of carrots to an Unathi settlement. We urgently need additional labelers to restore order in the warehouse as a matter of urgency.
bounty-description-warm-cloth = NanoTrasen is preparing a landing mission to an unexplored ice moon, and requires warm clothing for the expedition team.
bounty-description-battery = As an Arachnid settlement prepares for a solar flare, they are requesting a large shipment of power batteries. We're sending out a request for delivery.
bounty-description-lasergun = The Salvage Caravan requests a large shipment of laser weapons to mop up a hive of xenonids.
bounty-description-food = A rat king has ravaged a nearby station. An intrepid botanist managed to finish it off, but the kitchen has been picked clean. A large meat food shipment is needed.
bounty-description-vegetable = A rat king has ravaged a nearby station. An intrepid chef managed to finish it off, but the hydroponics bay has been picked clean. A large vegetable shipment is needed.
bounty-description-bandana = Bandanas are the latest fashion trend in a nearby sector. They can't get enough of the things. Help them out, please.
bounty-description-steak = A nearby civilian station is preparing a banquet, but their kitchen is struggling to keep up with demands. Send them some steak to ease the burden.
bounty-description-torch = A nearby station is dealing with an extended solar flare. They need some low-tech light sources to stave off the darkness.
bounty-description-wine = Our now-former co-worker blew up the bar. Send us some wine to help replenish our stock. Bottles or cans will both do fine.
bounty-description-ring = One of the higher-ups at CentComm is planning to propose to their partner. They need a pair of rings.
